direction: right
orig: Original Git source epoch
view: Historical view with exact source locator
live: Isolated mutable test snapshot
objects: Read-only Git object borrow
package: Verified installed package inventory
repo: Exact project inputs
labels: Shared owner-aware input attestations
query: Existing native ASCENT queries
checks: Existing currentness and byte checks
remote: Full CI and matched macOS remain independent
orig -> view: keep SHA and facts
view -> live: explicit fixture ownership transfer
orig -> objects: no checkout or source copy
package -> labels: package label
repo -> labels: project-relative label
labels -> checks
checks -> query
objects -> query: immutable output reader
live -> query: mutation tests
query -> remote: scope is not product acceptance
